## 6. Accessibility & SEO

| Check | Tool | How to Fix |
|-------|------|------------|
| **WCAG** | aXe, Lighthouse | Add `aria-*` attributes, semantic tags (`<header>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`) |
| **Image alt** | Manual review | Provide descriptive `alt` text |
| **Keyboard nav** | Manual testing | Ensure focus states, tab order |
| **Meta tags** | Next.js `Head` | Dynamic titles, descriptions, Open Graph |
| **Structured data** | JSON‑LD | Add `product` schema for each product page |

---

## 7. Testing

### 7.1. Unit Tests (Jest + React Testing Library)

```tsx
// src/components/__tests__/Button.test.tsx
import { render, screen } from '@testing-library/react';
import Button from '../Button';

test('renders button with text', () => {
  render(<Button>Click me</Button>);
  expect(screen.getByRole('button')).toHaveTextContent(/click me/i);
});
```

### 7.2. End‑to‑End (Cypress)

```js
// cypress/integration/cart.spec.js
describe('Cart flow', () => {
  it('adds a product to cart', () => {
    cy.visit('/');
    cy.contains('Add to Cart').click();
    cy.contains('Cart (1)');
  });
});
```

