| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `npm run dev` | Start dev server |
| `npm run build` | Production build |
| `npm run lint` | ESLint + Prettier |
| `npm test` | Jest tests |
| `npm run cypress:open` | Open Cypress UI |
